            "is_free": true,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Nova atualização</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/646820/extras/b74ed503a4e850ef15b37cc97f8cfd94.avif?t=1496680276\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>Welcome to the grand debut of Might &amp; Mayhem on Steam. Hearty greetings to the Steam community! Thanks for checking out the mightiest of mayhems!</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Get ready for Might &amp; Mayhem, a battle strategy game with live PvP battles and epic single-player quests. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/646820/extras/2a7c9ab92405e6649d81095022cb0250.avif?t=1496680276\" width=600 height=344 /></span><br><br>Bring the Mayhem. Fight for Might!<br>King Dragon's flames burned away the old realm, and his monsters rule the ashes. But an ember of hope still flickers, waiting for the right hero to rekindle it: You! Assemble your team of knights, bandits, wizards, goblins, robots and monsters, and strike out for adventure. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/646820/extras/ad0072e50babc88cabe86572a6c1274e.avif?t=1496680276\" width=600 height=344 /></span><br><br>Create new strategies with different fighter combinations and customize your troops with battle-changing items to destroy the competition and loot them for treasure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/646820/extras/6a9894375f41d4f1c06d4294d31d7247.avif?t=1496680276\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Conquer the Lost Kingdom and defeat King Dragon to save the realm, and become a Legendary Hero. Glory is YOURS for the taking!<br><br>Features:<br><br>◘ BATTLE your friends and foes in live PvP battles <br>◘ QUEST for glory with single-player missions and epic boss fights <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/646820/extras/2de42370d3065bb4623a20f280824020.avif?t=1496680276\" width=600 height=336 /></span><br><br>◘ LOOT enemies for gold and lost treasure <br>◘ CREATE an army of heroes from across the realm <br>◘ EXPLORE the Lost Kingdom in stunning 3D environments <br>◘ EVOLVE your troops from scrappy fighters to elite warriors <br>◘ CUSTOMIZE fighters by equipping battle-changing items <br>◘ DISCOVER new strategies with different fighter combinations<br><br>PLEASE NOTE! Might &amp; Mayhem is completely free to download and play. Some game items, however, can be purchased for real money. If you don’t want to use this feature, please disable in-app purchases in your settings.",
            "about_the_game": "Get ready for Might &amp; Mayhem, a battle strategy game with live PvP battles and epic single-player quests. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/646820/extras/2a7c9ab92405e6649d81095022cb0250.avif?t=1496680276\" width=600 height=344 /></span><br><br>Bring the Mayhem. Fight for Might!<br>King Dragon's flames burned away the old realm, and his monsters rule the ashes. But an ember of hope still flickers, waiting for the right hero to rekindle it: You! Assemble your team of knights, bandits, wizards, goblins, robots and monsters, and strike out for adventure. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/646820/extras/ad0072e50babc88cabe86572a6c1274e.avif?t=1496680276\" width=600 height=344 /></span><br><br>Create new strategies with different fighter combinations and customize your troops with battle-changing items to destroy the competition and loot them for treasure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/646820/extras/6a9894375f41d4f1c06d4294d31d7247.avif?t=1496680276\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Conquer the Lost Kingdom and defeat King Dragon to save the realm, and become a Legendary Hero. Glory is YOURS for the taking!<br><br>Features:<br><br>◘ BATTLE your friends and foes in live PvP battles <br>◘ QUEST for glory with single-player missions and epic boss fights <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/646820/extras/2de42370d3065bb4623a20f280824020.avif?t=1496680276\" width=600 height=336 /></span><br><br>◘ LOOT enemies for gold and lost treasure <br>◘ CREATE an army of heroes from across the realm <br>◘ EXPLORE the Lost Kingdom in stunning 3D environments <br>◘ EVOLVE your troops from scrappy fighters to elite warriors <br>◘ CUSTOMIZE fighters by equipping battle-changing items <br>◘ DISCOVER new strategies with different fighter combinations<br><br>PLEASE NOTE! Might &amp; Mayhem is completely free to download and play. Some game items, however, can be purchased for real money. If you don’t want to use this feature, please disable in-app purchases in your settings.",
            "short_description": "King Dragon's flames burned away the old realm, and his monsters rule the ashes. But an ember of hope still flickers, waiting for the right hero to rekindle it: You! Might &amp; Mayhem is a turn-based strategy rpg featuring live PvP battles, alliances and epic single-player quests.",
